* Mobile applications (Android & iOS)
* Kubernetes deployment
* Message scheduling
* Offline messaging
* Multi-language support

---

# 13. Conclusion

The Distributed Web-Based Real-Time Chat Application is designed to provide fast, secure, and scalable communication using modern distributed system architecture. By combining React, Node.js, MongoDB, Redis Pub/Sub, Socket.IO, Docker, and Nginx, the platform delivers reliable real-time messaging while supporting future enhancements such as AI integration, voice/video communication, and cloud-native deployment. This PRD defines the product vision, objectives, features, and technical direction for developing a robust, enterprise-ready chat application.
